f; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1. 설치방법</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;가. 안드로이드 폰: 플레이스토어에서 금오공과대학교 전자출결 검색 후 어플 설치(2023.3.7 이후 버전만 사용가능)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;나. 아이폰 앱스토어에서 금오공과대학교 전자출결 검색 후 어플 설치(2023.4.14. 이후 버전만 사용가능)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">전자출결시스템 기능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">블루투스를 통한 출석체크</span><